   "RCTs consistently show sit-stand desks reduce workplace sitting time, with the effect attenuating over time: ~100 min/day at short-term follow-up (≤3 months, 10 studies, low-quality evidence) down to ~57 min/day at medium-term follow-up (3-12 months, 2 studies), and no evidence exists beyond 12 months."
